{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1540406-supporter-merit","id":1540406,"title":"Supporter Merit","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-08-14T18:39:18-07:00","id":1540406,"title":"Supporter Merit","content":"Hi guys,<br /> <br /> &quot;Supporter (2 pt. Merit)You inspire all around you to greater efforts. Whether by speaking, writing, or leading by example, you give anyone who works with you reason to go on and hope of success. You have a \u20132 difficulty on Social rolls, and you give any group effort +1 to its total dice pool.&quot;<br /> <br /> On my game, I've said that this does not apply towards Spirits. I've had some players suggest otherwise. Can I get some feedback? <br /> <br /> Thank you!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23998-dynamiterave","name":"DynamiteRave","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-15T09:37:02-07:00","id":1540437,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DynamiteRave</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1540406-supporter-merit#post1540406\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi guys,<br /> <br /> &quot;Supporter (2 pt. Merit)You inspire all around you to greater efforts. Whether by speaking, writing, or leading by example, you give anyone who works with you reason to go on and hope of success. You have a \u20132 difficulty on Social rolls, and you give any group effort +1 to its total dice pool.&quot;<br /> <br /> On my game, I've said that this does not apply towards Spirits. I've had some players suggest otherwise. Can I get some feedback?<br /> <br /> Thank you!</div> </div> </div> </div>For us, it is as written, -2 difficulty on Social rolls, no restrictions. I don't see why Spirits would be excluded from this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-15T12:07:21-07:00","id":1540446,"title":"","content":"The wording on the Merit sucks... a flat -2 diff on &quot;all&quot; social rolls with no restrictions is ridiculous for a 2 pt. Merit.<br /> <br /> That said, yes, it should apply to spirits too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-15T12:19:54-07:00","id":1540451,"title":"","content":"In my group we've house ruled that the bonus die has restrictions in combat scenarios, basically it counts as an unrolled second action where you have to pay attention to the person(s) being supported to be able to offer them meaningful advice/encouragement. Also, we'd been running the difficulty reduction as though it applied to people who perceive themselves to be in a group with the character or to share at least a partial objective with the character. It'd been so long that I forgot how crazy the original wording was. Now that most the PCs are fosterns though the 'spend a whole action to give a couple +1 die-s' feels a little narrow, but then again, 2-point merit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27296-devidramoth","name":"Devidramoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27296_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"54"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-15T12:52:41-07:00","id":1540464,"title":"","content":"We had decent success house ruling it to a 1 dot Merit that just does the +1 die to group efforts thing (without it taking an action) that doesn't stack with other instances of it from other characters. In WtA esp. that bonus on Rites and pack tactics alone makes it a great little bonus to have handy, but that keeps it from being crazily good with the way it's RAW stated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-17T09:25:06-07:00","id":1540577,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1540406-supporter-merit?p=1540446#post1540446\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The wording on the Merit sucks... a flat -2 diff on &quot;all&quot; social rolls with no restrictions is ridiculous for a 2 pt. Merit.<br /> <br /> That said, yes, it should apply to spirits too.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yeah, this is &quot;Enchanting Voice&quot; merit for Werewolves. -2 reduction and no drawbacks or limitations? Too powerful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}